Response: To be honest, I am mostly concerned about more global issues in these regards, I would like national collaboration to make it easier to prevent climate catastrophe etc... 
Having said that, I do think that if we had a local government that would support e.g. local currencies and MMT principles, and that really empowers the local community to make our own decisions (in a somewhat controlled positive way) that would be great. I have some ideas how to implement some technology that would help locals coordinate and assess whether projects are 'positive', and possibly projects like this could spill over into national -> global governance. 
So, maybe a candidate that is also open to technology would be good. Progressive (not conservative), but also not focused on growth, but on _responsible' growth or even de-growth (or green growth).

